You are judging whether a task GATE — a start condition that will block the
task from moving to `to_do` or `in_progress` until it passes — is honestly
grounded in what the user actually asked for.

Below are the verbatim user messages the task's body cites (resolved from the
transcript by prepare, the ground truth for the task's own ask), followed by
the gate file itself.

